menuconfig MODULES_FOLDROTOR_CONTROL
	bool "foldrotor_control"
	default n
	---help---
		Enable support for foldrotor_control — the standalone position/
		velocity/attitude/rate/allocation module for the foldrotor3
		fully-actuated bi-rotor vehicle. Replaces mc_pos_control,
		mc_att_control, mc_rate_control, and control_allocator for that
		vehicle only; does not modify or disable those modules for any
		other airframe.
